Authority: `docs/goals/goal-phase-c-transfer.md`

## Goal
Extend export beyond CSV/TSV into database-friendly script formats while preserving exact value semantics and streaming behavior.

## Scope
Export sources:
- table;
- query result;
- selected rows.

Formats:
- SQL INSERT statements;
- batched multi-row INSERT where safe;
- PostgreSQL COPY text/CSV script where supported;
- optional DDL + data script mode only when existing schema DDL generation can be reused safely.

Requirements:
- deterministic identifier quoting;
- exact Decimal/BIGINT serialization;
- provider-aware NULL, binary, temporal, UUID, JSON handling;
- statement batching/size limits;
- progress/cancel;
- no full result materialization.

## Acceptance
- representative PostgreSQL + SQLite values export to valid replayable SQL;
- generated INSERT does not lose precision or corrupt quotes/newlines;
- PostgreSQL COPY output follows provider semantics;
- large exports remain bounded in memory;
- output is written via temp/atomic strategy where C01 supports it;
- service/native UI/runtime tests.

Merge independently to latest main.
Suggested commit: `feat(transfer): add SQL and COPY export formats`

